# Derived model: raise the served context of the 27B dense coder from the
# upstream tag's baked-in num_ctx=105000 to the model's full native 256K
# (262144, qwen35.context_length). The upstream
# SetneufPT/Qwen3.6-27B-CODER-MTP_Q4_105k_24GB-GPU pins PARAMETER num_ctx 105000
# in its Modelfile, and a Modelfile parameter OVERRIDES the OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH
# env — so the daemon env alone cannot lift the window. FROM-inheriting the tag
# and overriding only num_ctx keeps its weights (shared blobs), mmproj/vision,
# chat template, MTP draft head, and sampling params untouched.
#
# Fitting 256K in 24GB VRAM still requires the q4_0 KV cache set at daemon launch
# (OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q4_0 in start_ollama_qwen36_27b_coder.sh) — measured
# 100% GPU / 18GB / ~68 tok/s. q8_0 KV OOMs at 256K for this dense 27B.
#
# BUILD (agent-runnable; reuses shared blobs, no re-download):
#   ollama create qwen36-27b-coder-256k -f qwen36-27b-coder-256k.modelfile
FROM SetneufPT/Qwen3.6-27B-CODER-MTP_Q4_105k_24GB-GPU:latest
PARAMETER num_ctx 262144
